==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Clown Base (Enemy Base)|Clown Base]].
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Duche]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Master A.|Master As]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You need to take out the Master As quickly before they stack up, so strong and fast Cats like [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cats in a Box]] or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] will be good for the job. As for the Duches and Dagshunds, you'll need spammable melee Cats like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] or it's [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed variant]]. If you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], this stage becomes an absolute joke, as it will be able to solo this stage on its own.

